    "title": "Local malasada business fined after removing red placard - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kay Thomas ,\n5 hours ago HONOLULU (HawaiiNewsNow) - A local malasada business has been fined by the Hawaii Department of Health (DOH) Food Safety Branch for the intentional removal of a red “closed” placard. The DOH issued a notice of violation and order to Manuela Malasadas Co., LLC, doing business as Manuela Malasadas,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
